        "last_commit_sha": "851e3f2",
        "last_commit_message": "fix(agent-scan): accept null content deltas and usage-only chunks in SSE replies (#731)\n\nTool-call and reasoning chunks carry \"content\": null, which crashed the SSE accumulator with TypeError at \"\".join(...). With stream_options.include_usage the final chunk is usage-only (\"choices\": []), which crashed finish_reason extraction with IndexError.\n\nNow content is appended only when it is a string, and finish_reason is accumulated from the last chunk that carries one.\n\nVerified locally: both crashes reproduce on main; suite 68 -> 70 passed (2 new regression tests, zero drift).",
